Package: command-center
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, apt, unattended-upgrades, systemd, systemd-sysv, ca-certificates
Recommends: nftables
Description: native nftables host firewall and server administration CLI
 Command Center manages a bounded IPv4/IPv6 host firewall using libnftables,
 timed address bans, an optional OpenSSH journal guard, unattended-upgrades,
 and one-shot CPU, memory, filesystem, and inode reporting.
 .
 It provides drift detection, atomic kernel rule updates, durable recovery,
 and timed confirmation for live host-policy changes. The canonical command
 is command-center; the optional shortcut package supplies cm.

Package: command-center-shortcut
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, command-center (= ${binary:Version})
Conflicts: config-manager
Description: optional cm command shortcut for Command Center
 This package supplies /usr/bin/cm as a symlink to command-center.
 It is separate to avoid requiring an already-used short command name.
